OL,3,GNEWSAStormont emails reveal
OL,4,Aparamilitaries 'toxic' role in flags
OL,5,Adecisions
OL,6,
OL,7,FA contentious flag in Belfast stayed up
OL,8,Ffor several months after Stormont
OL,9,Fcontractors said support was needed
OL,10,Ffrom "community representatives with
OL,11,Fthe authority to order the removal".
OL,13,FThe remarks over a flag opposing the
OL,14,FIrish language were made in Department
OL,15,Ffor Infrastructure (DfI) emails seen by
OL,16,FBBC News NI.
OL,18,FAn Alliance Party assembly member said
OL,19,Fit showed the "toxic" impact of
OL,20,Fparamilitaries in some decisions over
OL,21,Fflags.
